From: Arthur Clark <mydevstuff@mail.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 04:21:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/33] Fork the UNO C++ bridge for QNX 8.0 (x86-64)

Fork gcc3_linux_x86-64 to gcc3_qnx_x86-64 and repoint the bridge
selection in Library_cpp_uno.mk. Built native-on-QDD against
libc++abi.so.1; x86-64 SysV code generation is shared with Linux.

